<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises to 6.95 pct on 3-mo Italian BOTs.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises to 6.95 pct on 3-mo Italian BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 38.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.95	(6.26)    98.37	  (98.48)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.73	(6.52)    96.77	  (96.87)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.57	(6.50)    93.85	  (93.90)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on January 10.</p>
</text>
